  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Wake up to a gulf view and breeze blowing through the palm trees. Have coffee and watch the sun rise over the gulf and the coastal dune lake.<br><br>Oasis East is truly one of the best locations on all of 30A. Here’s why:<br>1)\tPrivacy and seclusion has become rare on 30A. Oasis East is in Gulf Trace, a 55 home development that is surrounded by protected park on all sides. Most of the state park is inaccessible to the public, meaning there are rarely any people on the beach for 2000+ feet in either direction. Even during busy weeks it’s common to be one of only a few people on the beach for over a mile.<br>2)\tAccess to the gulf and a coastal dune lake- the home is located where a coastal dune lake meets the gulf. This makes for easy access to the lake for paddle boarding and fishing. The outfall (the place where the lake meets the gulf) is also a great place for kids to swim and play on days when the waves are too big. <br>3)\tProximity to Grayton Beach, Seaside and Blue Mountain- Grayton Beach, home of the Red Bar, is a 15-minute walk by beach and a 5-minute bike ride. Seaside and Blue Mountain are a 10-15 minute bike ride. Seaside is the most famous community on 30A and is great for shopping, dining, tennis and more. Blue Mountain Beach is considered the locals beach and has great restaurants, shops and Blue Mountain Creamery. One of our favorite thing to do is walk to the Red Bard for dinner by beach.<br><br>Here are other things about the home you will love:<br>1)\tThe home’s kitchen, bathrooms and living room were recently remodeled completely.<br>2)\tThe home has 4 bedrooms, two which face the gulf and dune lake.<br>3)\tThe home is loaded with included gear: daily beach service, two paddleboards, one fishing kayak, two 3-speed bikes, extra beach chairs, two coolers, beach towels, a gas grill, several boogie boards and sand toys, 2-kid bike trailer and beach wagon. There’s also an extra refrigerator for drinks.<br><br>Most of our available rental weeks are reserved well in advance by families who have stayed here for many years. Once you visit, you will see why. This location is unmatched on 30A! <br><br>We hope you to see you at Oasis East soon!<br><br>Parking for 4 cars.<br><br>Our full-service concierge team is ready to help with all of your vacation needs:<br>-\tprivate transportation<br>-\tbeachside cooler/drink delivery<br>-\tbike/gear rentals<br>-\tgrocery shopping<br>-\tand anything else you need while visiting! <br><br>Live Well 30A VIP Services | |",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Beachfront 4 Br Includes Jeep Paddle Boards Kayak Bikes"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
