        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We had a super fun experience and would go back.It was very clean and we enjoyed the overall natural light atmosphere and outside seating areas. There were 3 of us (adults) and there’s plenty of space for together time and solo time. A few things to note: The house is a double connected to another house (it appears that many of the houses in that area are large doubles) and it’s set alongside the dunes and outfall connecting Alligator Lake to the ocean with a house partially in front of it but there are adequate ocean views with a short walk to the beach. It is on the East side so no full sunset views from the property but the sunrise view is excellent.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Erin D.",
        "date": "2023-04-08T23:32:46Z",
