        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Beautiful/comfortable/well-equipped/modern home; spectacular location on a very private section of gorgeous white sandy beach; stunning Gulf and lake views from every room; convenient to reach everything (restaurants, groceries, rentals, etc); and a kind/caring/generous property manager.... all added up for the best result: the perfect week of holiday vacation.",
        "themes": [
